  "title": "Renewables: TotalEnergies divests 50% of a 424 MW portfolio in Greece",
  "summary": "Paris, December 17, 2025 – In line with its renewables business model, TotalEnergies has closed the sale to Asterion Industrial Partners of 50% of its 424 MW wind and solar portfolio in Greece. This transaction values the portfolio at €508 million, equivalent to approximately €1.2 million per MW installed. TotalEnergies retains a 50% stake and […]",
